# Preview DS rebuild

## Active work

- **New core:** `src/` (FSD) + `app/preview/` (App Router at `/preview/{city}`).
- **DS source of truth:** `src/shared/ui/**` with colocated `*.stories.tsx`.
- **Legacy core** (`pages/`, `modules/`, `components/`, `styles/`) — production at `/samara`; do not refactor unless the task explicitly targets legacy.
- **`stories/`** — archived failed Storybook-first attempt; reference only, no new DS work.

## Parity target

Design and UX must match legacy (`/samara`) and https://jacofood.ru/samara at **100%**. Read old code/styles for reference; implement in `src/`.

## Responsive (required for all components)

| Mode | Range |
|------|-------|
| compact (mobile) | 320–667 px |
| regular (tablet) | 668–990 px |
| expanded (desktop) | ≥ 991 px |

Tablet is a separate design target, not stretched mobile.

## Pixel-first → vw formulas

Layout uses fluid SCSS (`ui-fluid-compact/regular/expanded` in `src/shared/ui/foundation/_formulas.scss`). Reference captures (Chrome MCP, Playwright) must use **fixed pixel viewports** (320, 668, 991); measure computed px, then derive formula arguments. See `docs/tablet-adaptation-guide.md`.

## Visual verification

- Preview: `http://localhost:3000/preview/samara`
- Legacy: `http://localhost:3000/samara`
- Use **cursor-ide-browser** MCP for localhost smoke/screenshots; Playwright for scripted snapshots.
- Do not run lint/format/typecheck unless requested.

